--- title
# Christian Rafael de Souza Silva

## ML Systems, AI Infrastructure & Systems Software

--- body
I build software across two layers: production systems used by businesses and experimental systems built to understand the stack from first principles.

My current technical focus is **LLM training and inference, operating systems, compilers, virtual machines, GPU computing and low-level software**. I have worked professionally in software development since 2012 across enterprise systems, APIs, web and desktop applications.

