::: section projects
## Selected projects

A small set of projects that best represent my current work.

::: cards

::: card
### ChrisOS
**Operating systems · compilers · virtual machines**

An experimental x86-64 operating system and systems playground for building kernels, memory management, drivers, graphics, filesystems, compilers, assemblers, linkers, virtual machines and emulation components from scratch.

`C` `C++` `x86-64` `OSDev` `Compilers`

[Source >> https://github.com/christianrss/ChrisOS]
[Documentation >> https://os.christiansoftware.org]
:::

::: card
### Chris-GPT-2
**LLM pretraining · distributed GPU training**

A 124.5M-parameter GPT-2 trained from scratch on approximately 10B FineWeb-Edu tokens using 4× NVIDIA A100 GPUs, with reproducible training artifacts and SafeTensors/GGUF exports.

`Python` `PyTorch` `CUDA` `NCCL` `LLM Training`

[Source >> https://github.com/christianrss/chris-gpt-2]
[Model >> https://huggingface.co/christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m]
[GGUF >> https://huggingface.co/christianrss/chris-gpt-2-124m-GGUF]
:::

::: card
### Chris-Llama
**LLM inference runtime**

An experimental inference runtime in C for studying GGUF loading, tokenization, attention, KV cache, quantization, memory layout and CPU/GPU execution without hiding the implementation behind a large framework.

`C` `GGUF` `Inference` `Quantization` `CPU/GPU`

[Source >> https://github.com/christianrss/chris-llama]
:::

::: card
### Chris-Torch
**Deep learning framework from scratch**

A learning-oriented deep learning framework implementing tensors, automatic differentiation, neural-network components, optimizers and accelerated execution backends.

`C++` `Python` `Autograd` `Neural Networks` `GPU`

[Source >> https://github.com/christianrss/chris-torch]
:::

::: card
### Marginal Thinking
**Macroeconomics · markets · geopolitics**

An independent research platform focused on political economy, markets, technology and global systems, with recurring reports, country research, structural datasets and primary-source analysis.

`Research` `Economics` `Data` `Publishing`

[Visit >> https://marginalthinking.org/]
[Source >> https://github.com/logicvisionai/marginalthinking]
:::

::: card
### SharpEx
**Portfolio and market intelligence**

A market and portfolio-intelligence product covering multi-portfolio accounting, cross-asset market data, digital assets, risk-adjusted analytics and structural research integration.

`JavaScript` `Cloudflare Workers` `Market Data` `Risk Analytics`
:::

