::: section research
## Research & technical writing

::: cards

::: card
### Reproducible GPT-2 pretraining
Technical report documenting the 10-billion-token GPT-2 124M pretraining run, training setup, evaluation and reproducibility considerations.

[Paper >> https://www.researchgate.net/publication/412096883_A_Reproducible_10-Billion-Token_Pretraining_Run_of_GPT-2_124M]
:::

::: card
### Specializing GPT-2 for Linux
Study of continued pretraining and canonical instruction tuning for a Linux-focused 124M-parameter GPT-2, including failure analysis.

[Paper >> https://www.researchgate.net/publication/412275606_Specializing_a_124M-Parameter_GPT-2_for_Linux_Continued_Pretraining_Canonical_Instruction_Tuning_and_Failure_Analysis]
:::

